  "text": "\r\n\t\t Town Clerk | Newton, NH \r\n Skip to Main Content \r\nCreate a Website Account   - Manage notification subscriptions, save form progress and more.    \r\nWebsite Sign In \r\n     About  \t\t\t \n     Government   \t\t\t \n     Library   \t\t\t \n     Schools   \t\t\t \n     Find It Fast   \t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t Search \n\t\t\t Staff Contacts  \r\n\t\t\t Voter / Elections Information \r\n\t\t\t 2025 Town and School Results \r\n\t\t\t 2026 RABIES CLINIC \r\n\t\t\t 2026 SCHOOL SAMPLE BALLOT \r\n\t\t\t 2026 School Results \r\n\t\t\t 2026 TOWN SAMPLE BALLOT \r\n\t\t\t 2026 Town Results \r\n\t\t\t Bill of Sale for Watercraft \r\n\t\t\t Boat Registration \r\n\t\t\t Dog Licensing \r\n\t\t\t Driver Licensing \r\n\t\t\t Estimator for Vehicle Registration \r\n\t\t\t Election Results Archive \r\n\t\t\t Forms and Applications \r\n\t\t\t Hunting and Fishing Licenses \r\n\t\t\t January 1st DMV Fees \r\n\t\t\t Marriage Licensing \r\n\t\t\t Notary Services \r\n\t\t\t OHRV Registrations \r\n\t\t\t Online Services \r\n\t\t\t Vehicle Inspections \r\n\t\t\t Vehicle Registrations \r\n\t\t\t Vital Records \r\n\t\t\t Welcome New Residents! \r\nHome \nGovernment \nDepartments \nTown Clerk \r\nTown Clerk\t\t \r\nThe Town Clerk's Office Newton is a full-service department, offering  motor vehicle title & registration services ,  vital record assistance  (marriage licenses, death, divorce, birth, & marriage certificates),  dog licensing ,  voter registration ,  OHRV registrations , and  hunting/fishing licenses . We also offer  notary public  and Justice of the Peace services. Marriage ceremonies are not performed by the JP.  New  and current residents alike are encouraged to contact us prior to coming in if they have any questions regarding proper procedures. We accept checks, cash, credit & debit cards for payment. Please note that if you are paying by card, there will be charged an additional 2.99% (minimum $2.50) fee. \r\nContact Us \r\nTown Clerk \r\n\t\t\t\t\t Physical Address \r\n View Map \t\t\t\t\t \n\t\t\t\t\t 2 Town Hall Road \n\t\t\t\t\t Newton ,  NH   03858 \r\n2 Town Hall Road  Newton NH 03858 \r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t Directions \r\nPhone:  (603) 382-4405 Ext. 4 \r\nHours of Operation: \nMonday, Tuesday & Wednesday: 8:00 am to 4:00 pm \nThursday:  10:00 am - 6:00 pm \nFriday: Closed \r\nDirectory \r\nFAQs \r\n             Where do I get a 20 day temporary plate? \r\n             May I renew my vehicles online? \r\n             What do I need to renew my car registration? \r\n         View All FAQs \r\n/FAQ.aspx \r\n\t\t\t Minutes, Agendas & Videos \r\n\t\t\t E-Subscriber \r\n\t\t\t Right to Know \r\n\t\t\t Job Opportunities \r\n\t\t\t Online Payments \r\n\t\t\t Voter Information \r\nNewton \r\nTown Hall \r\n2 Town Hall Road, \r\nNewton, NH 03858 \r\nPH:  (603) 382-4405 \r\n         Home \n         Site Map \n         Accessibility \n         Copyright Notices \n         Privacy Policy \n/QuickLinks.aspx \r\n   Government Websites by  CivicPlus® \nLoading \r\n\t\t\t\tLoading\r\n\t\t\t Do Not Show Again \r\n\t\t\t Close \r\n\t\t\t Arrow Left \r\n\t\t\t Arrow Right \r\n[] \r\n                     Slideshow Left Arrow \r\n                     Slideshow Right Arrow \r\n ",
